drops</b></div></article><article class="recipe-card"><h3>Materials & recipes</h3><p>Gather in the world or earn rare materials from bosses.</p><div class="recipe-line"><span>Sunleaf · Slime Gel · Iron Ore</span><b>${state.materials.Sunleaf||0} · ${state.materials['Slime Gel']||0} · ${state.materials['Iron Ore']||0}</b></div><div class="recipe-line"><span>Critical chance cap</span><b>50%</b></div></article></div>`;openModal('The village forge','CRAFTING & FUSION',body,true)}
